1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,992
This is Optional Reality.

2
00:00:01,992 --> 00:00:03,732
You don't control the ball.

3
00:00:03,732 --> 00:00:06,169
You change the rules of its world.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,614
Write a change, then choose when to send it.

5
00:00:11,614 --> 00:00:14,809
Brake the drift, keep the momentum, and find your way home.

6
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,775
Make surfaces bouncier, and turn a collision into a new direction.

7
00:00:22,775 --> 00:00:25,178
The physics and three-star finishes are real.

8
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,009
Meet the toaster.

9
00:00:32,009 --> 00:00:36,718
Power it up, store energy on contact, then launch the loaf toward the exit.

10
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:43,026
Write in any language supported by Google Gemini.

11
00:00:43,026 --> 00:00:44,123
Change the rules.

12
00:00:44,123 --> 00:00:45,220
Choose the moment.
